00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:07.020
And this is the the
rules that council has.

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:09.340
Council has established this
public forum to receive input

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:10.300
from the community.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:11.460
The public invited to be heard.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:13.500
Portion of the meeting is
limited by council rules for a

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.820
total of one hour, which each
speaker allotted three minutes.

00:07:16.860 --> 00:07:19.780
Speakers signed up to comment
on agenda item is also limited

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.060
to three minutes, and the
comments must relate directly

00:07:22.060 --> 00:07:23.900
to the item that's
being considered.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.620
All participants are expected
to observe the same standards

00:07:26.620 --> 00:07:28.060
of decorum as the City Council.

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:30.740
Personal attacks, disruptive
behavior, and demonstrations

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:33.460
are not are not permitted.

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.700
Please show respect to all
speakers regardless of whether

00:07:35.700 --> 00:07:38.100
you agree with their comments,
but please allow everyone the

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.540
opportunity to be heard.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:41.900
Speakers exceed the three
minute time limit will reduce

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.020
the opportunity for
others to speak.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:46.230
Please be considerate of your
fellow residents for preparing

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:46.630
your comments.

00:07:46.670 --> 00:07:49.390
Additionally, please refrain
from using profanity as

00:07:49.390 --> 00:07:51.710
children may be watching
the meeting their.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:54.430
Public in order to be heard.

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:56.630
Mindy Schaffner.

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:58.710
