00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:25.390
This week marks two years since
the community has been coming

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:30.790
to this council to express and
address concerns, cries and

00:08:30.790 --> 00:08:34.390
pain from the loss of
life by the police.

00:08:36.470 --> 00:08:41.270
Some things have changed since
that start of this journey.

00:08:42.070 --> 00:08:45.390
We've seen a change in
leadership of the city

00:08:47.230 --> 00:08:51.910
and we also, interestingly
enough, saw a change in the

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:54.150
police chief that was initially

00:08:54.150 --> 00:08:57.510
here when we started
this journey.

00:09:00.230 --> 00:09:02.350
The change in the police chief

00:09:03.270 --> 00:09:06.550
came through a lens
that was inequitable,

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:08.510
non-transparent

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.710
and has perpetuated the
problems that we continue to

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:15.270
see with the police.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:20.350
One thing that has not changed

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:22.870
is the consistency
of the community.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:30.390
One thing that will never
change is the grief of the

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:31.510
people who have to.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:32.110
Suffer.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:36.790
Every single day because
their loved one is gone.

00:09:36.830 --> 00:09:38.830
Every holiday, every birthday,

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:43.760
every moment of celebration
becomes tragically beautiful.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:49.600
What changes we need to see

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.680
are a shift in the
culture of this city.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:10:00.600
Policing is a symptom
of leadership of a city.

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.440
We've heard other community
members talk about Newark, new

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.040
Jersey in this chamber.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:14.480
This year, Newark, new Jersey
has had only five homicides

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:15.640
year to date.

00:10:16.520 --> 00:10:17.320
Five.

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:22.400
Because what they did

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.440
is they didn't just sit idle.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.040
They actually changed

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.800
the way that the city was ran.

00:10:32.720 --> 00:10:36.280
So on this week,
that marks two years.

00:10:37.280 --> 00:10:44.170
I want everyone to hear me when
I say cheers to another two and

00:10:44.170 --> 00:10:47.530
another two and another two and
another two, until we get the

00:10:47.530 --> 00:10:50.210
changes that this city deserves.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.650
We will not stop.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.610
We will only continue
to get stronger,

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.850
because this community is
now building a coalition

00:11:04.290 --> 00:11:07.330
of families that are
experiencing this pain.

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:13.890
And there's not none of you
on this dais that can deny the

00:11:13.890 --> 00:11:15.970
power of that coalition

00:11:17.650 --> 00:11:19.090
fire. Todd.

