non-monetary solutions, rooted

01:14:16.750 --> 01:14:20.270
and lived experience and
community, wisdom and desire to

01:14:20.310 --> 01:14:22.510
prevent harm, we are denied.

01:14:22.510 --> 01:14:24.350
We are judged and ridiculed.

01:14:24.390 --> 01:14:26.630
We are told our
voices are too loud.

01:14:26.670 --> 01:14:28.280
Our grief is too heavy.

01:14:28.320 --> 01:14:30.480
Our presence is too disruptive.

01:14:31.160 --> 01:14:34.240
But I am not here for
backlash or get back.

01:14:34.280 --> 01:14:36.720
I am here to remind
you who we are.

01:14:37.280 --> 01:14:41.720
We are the families, women,
children and elders who are

01:14:41.720 --> 01:14:44.960
unseen, unheard until
votes are needed.

01:14:45.000 --> 01:14:48.800
We are the families labeled as
mobs and goons until the city

01:14:48.840 --> 01:14:51.680
needs dollars, headlines
or photo opportunities.

01:14:51.960 --> 01:14:55.440
We are the same families as
some of you once claimed.

01:14:55.440 --> 01:14:57.160
We are only here for money.

01:14:57.240 --> 01:15:00.880
While I'm thankful that we have
a stance to not be biased and

01:15:00.880 --> 01:15:03.800
we can still stand even
when you are in need.

01:15:04.120 --> 01:15:07.560
And when you go to the streets,
the shelters, the community

01:15:07.600 --> 01:15:10.320
spaces to connect,
it is noticeable.

01:15:10.320 --> 01:15:13.800
It is noticeable when the goal
is only to shake hands, kiss

01:15:13.800 --> 01:15:16.960
babies, and collect headlines
instead of building solutions

01:15:16.960 --> 01:15:18.200
that save lives.

01:15:18.240 --> 01:15:19.600
Yet here we stand.

01:15:19.600 --> 01:15:21.000
We stand with backbones.

01:15:21.000 --> 01:15:24.480
After bearing broken pieces of
our hearts, we stand with truth

01:15:24.480 --> 01:15:27.450
in our mouths and grief on our
hands while you show us time

01:15:27.450 --> 01:15:30.370
and time again that you cannot
stand with the wishbone.

01:15:30.410 --> 01:15:31.730
Wishing things were better

01:15:31.730 --> 01:15:33.890
instead of working
to make them better.

01:15:34.370 --> 01:15:36.250
Our voices will not be silenced.

01:15:36.250 --> 01:15:38.610
And we will continue to stand.

01:15:38.650 --> 01:15:43.330
To stand for our liberty, to
stand for our justice and to

01:15:43.330 --> 01:15:46.530
assure that it
finally means for all.

01:15:47.610 --> 01:15:52.490
We are coming together and
this is showing you unity.

01:15:52.530 --> 01:15:58.970
We decided to show by action it
would be nice for you to show

01:15:59.010 --> 01:16:00.170
