01:27:55.590 --> 01:28:00.200
First, I want to recognize
housing is a basic human right.

01:28:00.560 --> 01:28:03.200
Running water is a
basic human right.

01:28:03.240 --> 01:28:06.440
Consistent electricity
is a basic human right.

01:28:06.560 --> 01:28:09.440
Functional plumbing is
a basic human right.

01:28:09.520 --> 01:28:13.440
Living free of infestations and
mold is a basic human right.

01:28:13.520 --> 01:28:17.440
Having functional climate
control throughout the year is

01:28:17.440 --> 01:28:18.680
a basic human right.

01:28:18.920 --> 01:28:21.600
This resolution is about
accountability and protecting

01:28:21.640 --> 01:28:23.880
tenants for far too long.

01:28:23.920 --> 01:28:26.400
As you've heard already,
landlords and Aurora have

01:28:26.400 --> 01:28:29.800
