disrepair and actively harm

01:28:34.120 --> 01:28:35.920
tenants and their well-being.

01:28:36.560 --> 01:28:39.800
There is also a widespread
continuation of junk fees by

01:28:39.800 --> 01:28:45.160
landlords that is banned
by HB 25, 1090 and 251249.

01:28:46.240 --> 01:28:49.320
This program can help put a
stop to these legal or to these

01:28:49.320 --> 01:28:50.440
illegal practices.

01:28:51.200 --> 01:28:52.880
Many of the aforementioned

01:28:52.880 --> 01:28:54.880
landlords are also
repeat offenders.

01:28:54.880 --> 01:28:57.680
As you've heard, it has been
hard without a rental registry

01:28:57.730 --> 01:28:59.850
program to hold these landlords

01:28:59.890 --> 01:29:02.450
