01:38:04.120 --> 01:38:07.440
My name is Nasim, and I would
like to share my experience

01:38:07.600 --> 01:38:09.840
living at Grace
apartment in Denver.

01:38:10.080 --> 01:38:14.120
I left I live on the border
of Denver and Aurora.

01:38:14.240 --> 01:38:17.400
Grace apartment was my first
home when I arrived in the

01:38:17.400 --> 01:38:20.080
United States with my family.

01:38:20.120 --> 01:38:24.240
At that time, I was new here
and I was grateful to have a

01:38:24.240 --> 01:38:25.120
place to live.

01:38:25.160 --> 01:38:30.800
However, after only about about
two weeks, I started noticing

01:38:30.840 --> 01:38:33.640
many maintenance issues
inside the apartment.

01:38:33.920 --> 01:38:37.720
There were problems with the
heating system, kitchen, stove

01:38:37.770 --> 01:38:38.490
and light.

01:38:38.530 --> 01:38:41.250
During the winter, the
apartment becomes extremely

01:38:41.250 --> 01:38:45.370
cold because of the heater
was not working properly.

01:38:45.370 --> 01:38:49.210
I reported these issues to the
management, but their repair

01:38:49.250 --> 01:38:50.970
process was very slow.

01:38:52.010 --> 01:38:53.290
Because of the cold.

01:38:53.290 --> 01:38:58.010
I had to buy a heater myself,
which caused my electricity

01:38:58.090 --> 01:39:03.530
bill to increase significantly,
sometimes up to around $200 in

01:39:03.530 --> 01:39:04.330
one month.

01:39:04.370 --> 01:39:07.130
This was very difficult
for my family.

01:39:07.130 --> 01:39:11.130
When I reported other issues
such as the stove and lighting,

01:39:11.130 --> 01:39:15.010
I was often told that the
problems were not emergencies,

01:39:15.210 --> 01:39:21.250
and in that I had to wait two
weeks, 2 to 3 weeks for repair

01:39:21.450 --> 01:39:24.410
as the tenant paying
rent on the time.

01:39:25.090 --> 01:39:27.890
The situation was very
challenging for me.

01:39:28.850 --> 01:39:33.570
Later I learned about S3 East
Colfax Community Collective

01:39:33.650 --> 01:39:35.250
through a friend.

01:39:35.620 --> 01:39:39.060
S3 was a very helpful
to me and to others.

01:39:39.060 --> 01:39:42.380
Residents were facing
similar housing problems.

01:39:42.860 --> 01:39:46.420
They supported us in
understanding our rights as

01:39:46.420 --> 01:39:49.580
tenants and helped us
communicate properly with the

01:39:49.580 --> 01:39:52.660
