with their assistance.

01:39:53.540 --> 01:39:57.660
We were able to make formal
complaints and ensure that our

01:39:57.660 --> 01:39:59.740
concerns were taken seriously.

01:40:01.420 --> 01:40:05.380
I am very thankful for
increased support because they

01:40:05.380 --> 01:40:09.700
helped many residents who were
struggling with housing issues

01:40:09.700 --> 01:40:12.980
and helped us understanding
what is the right and what

01:40:13.020 --> 01:40:14.580
action we can take.

01:40:15.100 --> 01:40:18.860
After EC3 became involved
with some of the issues were

01:40:18.900 --> 01:40:22.860
addressed and later I also
noticed that there was new

01:40:22.860 --> 01:40:25.060
management address apartments.

01:40:25.100 --> 01:40:29.540
Since then, improvements have
been made and maintenance

01:40:29.540 --> 01:40:31.820
responses are no faster.

01:40:32.020 --> 01:40:33.700
I am sharing my
experience today.

01:40:33.790 --> 01:40:38.190
Not to complain, but to give
feedback so that housing

01:40:38.190 --> 01:40:41.750
service and living conditions
can continue to improve for all

01:40:41.750 --> 01:40:43.870
residents in Aurora and Denver.

01:40:44.030 --> 01:40:47.110
Thank you for your
time and for listening.

